---
import Layout from "../../layouts/layout.astro"
import Main from '../../components/main.astro'
---

<Layout title="about the fanlisting!">
    <Main>
        <h1 class="text-center text-lime-600">about the fanlisting</h1>
        <h2 class="italic text-lime-700 text-sm mx-10">what even is a fanlisting?</h2>
        <blockquote class="rounded border-l-lime-300 border-l-4 bg-lime-100 px-2 text-sm">
            A fanlisting is simply an online listing of fans of a subject, such as a TV show, actor, or musician, that is created by an individual and open for fans from around the world to join. There are no costs, and the only requirements to join a fanlisting are your name and country. Fanlistings do not have to be large sites (although some are) - they are just a place where you can have your name listed along with other fans of the same subject. TheFanlistings.org is the original (but not only) web directory for fanlistings, dedicated to uniting fans across the globe. <span class="underline decoration-dotted decoration-2 italic text-lime-500"><a href="http://www.thefanlistings.org/">- thefanlisting.org</a></span>
        </blockquote>
        <h2 class="italic text-lime-700 text-sm mx-10">Why did you make this fanlisting?</h2>
        <article>
            <p class="mx-3">
                i made this fanlisting because I am a very big fan of matcha lattes, it is one of my favorite drinks ever! I wanted to connect with people who share similar interests!
            </p>
        </article>
        <h2 class="italic text-lime-700 text-sm mx-10">can i join?</h2>
        <article>
            <p class="mx-3">
                absolutely anyone is free to join! all you have to do is submit the form
            </p>
        </article>
    </Main>
</Layout>
<style>
    a{
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: inherit;
    }
</style>